{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "c8e83bfad2c6ed76cc67d7c3a62bd3c17a76e073b5abf56a50d60b29cc435254", "ja": "パワフル中華で猛進中！", "zh": "靠强劲中华料理勇往直前！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7ad9a98442d04114c403c0f50a006a63f0367e9a1bf8fe08895a62bffb0afab6", "ja": "真っ先に動いたのは、中華料理担当の美奈子\nチーム。メンバー分の食事を用意することで\n味方へのカロリーを補給し続け、勝利への\nサイクルを完成させる。\nカロリーを燃やして、カロリーを作れ！", "zh": "最先行动的是负责中华料理的美奈子\n队伍。通过为成员准备饭菜，不断为\n队友补充卡路里，完成通往胜利的\n循环。\n燃烧卡路里，创造卡路里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "21c6d0a029f0d1268440d610e094a8f9e85b54403125b3c9cbfe5013a329df16", "ja": "（なんだか食欲をそそる、いいにおいが……。\n出どころは、美奈子達のチームかな？）", "zh": "（总觉得有股让人食欲大开的香味……来源是美奈子她们的队伍吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "8f1b62a6dcff841903e6944fb2f0aafd0937199a0a98725be90ca230705aac92", "ja": "私が調理に集中できるよう、みんながサポートして\nくれるので。今日は思いきり腕を振るっちゃいますよ！", "zh": "因为大家都在支持我，让我能专心烹饪。今天我要大展身手啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "da3c5a45520e2452a32e3795b81dc9aa542d8f1023a8a5f7936e449b653f108f", "ja": "す……すごい。ギョウザやシューマイが、\nもうお皿に山盛りになって……。", "zh": "好……好厉害。饺子和烧麦已经堆满盘子了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "bbfd75243d19dae302cc8d66a586bf8463195dac33bca79f5dcedc54f4f79d5d", "ja": "あ、それは料理対決用じゃないよ？\nまずは、チームのみんなに食べてもらおうと思って。", "zh": "啊，那不是拿来参加料理对决的哦？\n我想先让队里的大家尝尝看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "69af9b8182d2a2f33ca7672ba395edffcb6fc43cfba622a5ddf66c2e768b9194", "ja": "……えっ？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "eaf3a551d836a3cba05853907541fa0fe44d784691838e2072f4de20d6a0b074", "ja": "料理の手伝いだって、頑張ればお腹がすくでしょ？\n運動しながらだったら、なおさらだよね。", "zh": "就算是帮忙做饭，只要努力去做了也会肚子饿吧？\n要是边运动边做的话，就更是这样了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "b475cc946f751b4137508ef47887aa0ef40c7e30793bc8b891a8bf7dfc6c28f6", "ja": "お腹がすいていたら、全力の勝負なんてできない……\nだから、みんなのカロリーは私が守るよ！", "zh": "肚子饿了的话，就没法全力以赴地较量……\n所以，大家的热量就由我来守护！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1007_045kar", "source_sha256": "49fa83b0b0c5dd4481d20a2ccbca6470db9128eb702a54c01a830be83d8ed77d", "ja": "さ、さすが美奈子さん……！　でも……\nし、食材が、足りなくならないでしょうか……？", "zh": "不、不愧是美奈子小姐……！可是……\n食、食材不会不够用吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "f9252dad99f1edf405487c46d37f132d3464511b11e5627bbfb455831ba88e79", "ja": "大丈夫！　なくなったら、収穫エリアで\nたくさん手に入れてくればいいんだよ♪", "zh": "没问题！要是用完了，只要去收获区\n多采摘一些回来就好啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0206_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0206_story_02_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "6fcff097e0c246392feda61f24068c889598ff1b4ea76e1cfcbb0e375afb7e3d", "ja": "これが私達の、勝利のサイクル！\n悪いけど、優勝は譲らないよ！　わっほ～い！！", "zh": "这就是我们的胜利循环！\n不好意思，冠军可不会让给你们！哇吼——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
